  "critical": false,
  "description": "Design and construction of fixed-wing UAVs — unmanned aircraft that generate lift through wing surfaces rather than rotor thrust. Fixed-wing drones offer longer endurance and higher range than multirotors at the cost of requiring a runway or catapult launch and forward speed to stay airborne. Used for long-range survey, pipeline inspection, and medium-altitude reconnaissance. Builds on full-scale aviation aerodynamics (aerospace.aviation) scaled down to 1-25 kg gross weight, with electric motor propulsion and composite or foam airframes.",
